From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:05:50 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] ASoC: samsung: abox: import 4.14 ABOX sources verbatim

Import, unmodified, the Samsung ABOX audio DSP driver (Exynos 9610 "Calliope"
firmware) and its public headers, as a reference base for the 6.18
forward-port. Source: A50 baseline kernel, branch halium-a50-aa17rf2,
commit 4f37ef39 (Samsung/FreshROMs Mint 4.14.194). The Richtek amplifier
variant of the synchronized IPC is left out (the A50 uses an NXP TFA9872).

Scope (M10.1 boundary): ABOX core, GIC, RDMA/WDMA, UAIF/DSIF/SPDY, effect,
log/debug and the components the core references (VSS, BT, VDMA, dump,
failsafe, mmapfd), plus the synchronized IPC used by the TFA9872 driver.
Nothing is built yet: Kconfig and Makefile come with the 6.18 adaptation
commits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Iad61601091599f9d5f5d72bbdae14399fc79e269
